The rules engine is Forge (Card-Forge/forge), Copyright (C) 2011 Forge
Team and contributors, also licensed under the GNU General Public
License, version 3. This project pins Forge commit
733a221e35613ec146ae4573df5406661c71c6f3 (version 2.0.16-SNAPSHOT).
Forge is not vendored in this repository. Docker clones that commit
when the image is built. Source: https://github.com/Card-Forge/forge

Card images are not included. The app asks Scryfall for them when a
card is shown. Scryfall's artwork is used under their API guidelines
and is not redistributed here. https://scryfall.com/docs/api

Deck links are read from Moxfield's public deck endpoint when the
CDN allows it. Deck lists you paste stay in the data folder on the
machine that hosts the app.
